"unit_id": "t0019.u01",
"sent_id": "t0019.s01"
},
{
"start": 871.8,
"end": 876.6,
"speaker_label": "Diego Ferrer",
"text": "Once you understand that, the rest of the decisions become easier.",
"char_start": 3516,
"char_end": 3582,
"unit_id": "t0019.u01",
"sent_id": "t0019.s02"
},
{
"start": 876.6,
"end": 877.68,
"speaker_label": "Lucía Herrera",
"text": "Let's start there.",
"char_start": 3598,
"char_end": 3616,
"unit_id": "t0020.u01",
"sent_id": "t0020.s01"
},
{
"start": 877.74,
"end": 881.34,
"speaker_label": "Lucía Herrera",
"text": "What's something you used to believe about this that you've since re-evaluated?",
"char_start": 3617,
"char_end": 3696,
"unit_id": "t0020.u01",
"sent_id": "t0020.s02"
},
{
"start": 881.34,
"end": 882.18,
"speaker_label": "Diego Ferrer",
"text": "That's how I see it.",
"char_start": 3711,
"char_end": 3731,
"unit_id": "t0021.u01",
"sent_id": "t0021.s01"
},
{
"start": 882.24,
"end": 888.36,
"speaker_label": "Diego Ferrer",
"text": "The wear and tear on the chain is the best early indicator of when you'll need to replace the cassette.",
"char_start": 3732,
"char_end": 3835,
"unit_id": "t0021.u01",
"sent_id": "t0021.s02"
},
{
"start": 888.42,
"end": 891.0,
"speaker_label": "Diego Ferrer",
"text": "We've seen this in equipment that uses Shimano components.",
"char_start": 3836,
"char_end": 3894,
"unit_id": "t0021.u01",
"sent_id": "t0021.s03"
},
{
"start": 891.06,
"end": 895.86,
"speaker_label": "Diego Ferrer",
"text": "Once you understand that, the rest of the decisions become easier.",
"char_start": 3895,
"char_end": 3961,
"unit_id": "t0021.u01",
"sent_id": "t0021.s04"
},
{
"start": 895.86,
"end": 897.36,
"speaker_label": "Lucía Herrera",
"text": "That makes sense.",
"char_start": 3977,
"char_end": 3994,
"unit_id": "t0022.u01",
"sent_id": "t0022.s01"
},
{
"start": 897.36,
"end": 906.78,
"speaker_label": "Diego Ferrer",
"text": "And when teams adopt Spoke & Wrench within that workflow, the value becomes apparent. If you ignore that, you'll end up rebuilding it from scratch a year later.",
"char_start": 4009,
"char_end": 4169,
"unit_id": "t0023.u01",
"sent_id": "t0023.s01"
},
{
"start": 906.78,
"end": 907.86,
"speaker_label": "Lucía Herrera",
"text": "Let's start with that.",
"char_start": 4185,
"char_end": 4207,
"unit_id": "t0024.u01",
"sent_id": "t0024.s01"
},
{
"start": 907.92,
"end": 912.6,
"speaker_label": "Lucía Herrera",
"text": "What is the operational aspect that most listeners don't have access to?",
"char_start": 4208,
"char_end": 4280,
"unit_id": "t0024.u01",
"sent_id": "t0024.s02"
},
{
"start": 912.6,
"end": 913.44,
"speaker_label": "Diego Ferrer",
"text": "That's how I see it.",
"char_start": 4295,
"char_end": 4315,
"unit_id": "t0025.u01",
"sent_id": "t0025.s01"
},
{
"start": 913.5,
"end": 918.48,
"speaker_label": "Diego Ferrer",
"text": "The service intervals for the suspension are a risk management decision.",
"char_start": 4316,
"char_end": 4388,
"unit_id": "t0025.u01",
"sent_id": "t0025.s02"
},
{
"start": 918.54,
"end": 921.96,
"speaker_label": "Diego Ferrer",
"text": "I've seen this pattern repeat itself in three different teams.",
"char_start": 4389,
"char_end": 4451,
"unit_id": "t0025.u01",
"sent_id": "t0025.s03"
},
{
"start": 1320.0,
