"char_end": 5142,
"unit_id": "t0030.u01",
"sent_id": "t0030.s01"
},
{
"start": 1355.22,
"end": 1359.9,
"speaker_label": "Lucía Herrera",
"text": "What is the opposing perspective that most listeners don't have access to?",
"char_start": 5143,
"char_end": 5217,
"unit_id": "t0030.u01",
"sent_id": "t0030.s02"
},
{
"start": 1359.9,
"end": 1366.62,
"speaker_label": "Diego Ferrer",
"text": "It all boils down to this: a bike should feel quiet and predictable so that your focus remains on the trail.",
"char_start": 5232,
"char_end": 5340,
"unit_id": "t0031.u01",
"sent_id": "t0031.s01"
},
{
"start": 1366.68,
"end": 1370.46,
"speaker_label": "Diego Ferrer",
"text": "The frame matters because it tells you what compromises you're making.",
"char_start": 5341,
"char_end": 5411,
"unit_id": "t0031.u01",
"sent_id": "t0031.s02"
},
{
"start": 1370.46,
"end": 1372.2,
"speaker_label": "Lucía Herrera",
"text": "What does the failure mode look like?",
"char_start": 5427,
"char_end": 5464,
"unit_id": "t0032.u01",
"sent_id": "t0032.s01"
},
{
"start": 1372.26,
"end": 1376.22,
"speaker_label": "Lucía Herrera",
"text": "What is the most underestimated aspect of transmission mechanics?",
"char_start": 5465,
"char_end": 5530,
"unit_id": "t0032.u01",
"sent_id": "t0032.s02"
},
{
"start": 1376.22,
"end": 1383.18,
"speaker_label": "Diego Ferrer",
"text": "Honestly, the wear and tear on the chain is the best early indicator of when you'll need to replace the cassette.",
"char_start": 5545,
"char_end": 5658,
"unit_id": "t0033.u01",
"sent_id": "t0033.s01"
},
{
"start": 1383.24,
"end": 1385.82,
"speaker_label": "Diego Ferrer",
"text": "We've seen this in equipment that uses Shimano components.",
"char_start": 5659,
"char_end": 5717,
"unit_id": "t0033.u01",
"sent_id": "t0033.s02"
},
{
"start": 1385.88,
"end": 1389.3,
"speaker_label": "Diego Ferrer",
"text": "I've observed this pattern repeating itself in three different sets of equipment.",
"char_start": 5718,
"char_end": 5799,
"unit_id": "t0033.u01",
"sent_id": "t0033.s03"
},
{
"start": 1389.3,
"end": 1391.04,
"speaker_label": "Lucía Herrera",
"text": "Where does that stop working?",
"char_start": 5815,
"char_end": 5844,
"unit_id": "t0034.u01",
"sent_id": "t0034.s01"
},
{
"start": 1391.04,
"end": 1399.5,
"speaker_label": "Diego Ferrer",
"text": "And when teams adopt Shimano equipment within that system, the benefits become apparent – I've seen this pattern repeat itself in three different teams.",
"char_start": 5859,
"char_end": 6011,
"unit_id": "t0035.u01",
"sent_id": "t0035.s01"
},
{
"start": 1399.5,
"end": 1402.38,
"speaker_label": "Lucía Herrera",
"text": "What is the heuristic that you always rely on?",
"char_start": 6027,
"char_end": 6073,
"unit_id": "t0036.u01",
"sent_id": "t0036.s01"
},
{
"start": 1402.44,
"end": 1406.22,
"speaker_label": "Lucía Herrera",
"text": "Where do maintenance and transmission mechanics intersect?",
"char_start": 6074,
"char_end": 6132,
"unit_id": "t0036.u01",
"sent_id": "t0036.s02"
},
{
"start": 1406.22,
"end": 1412.04,
"speaker_label": "Diego Ferrer",
"text": "Frankly, the service intervals for the suspension are a risk management decision.",
"char_start": 6147,
"char_end": 6228,
"unit_id": "t0037.u01",
"sent_id": "t0037.s01"
},
{
"start": 1412.1,
"end": 1416.36,
"speaker_label": "Diego Ferrer",
"text": "And the second-order effect is the part that almost everyone overlooks.",
"char_start": 6229,
"char_end": 6300,
"unit_id": "t0037.u01",
"sent_id": "t0037.s02"
},
{
"start": 1680.0,
"end": 1684.68,
"speaker_label": "Lucía Herrera",
"text": "Before we wrap up, what's one thing that listeners can try out this week?",
"char_start": 6316,
"char_end": 6389,
"unit_id": "t0038.u01",
"sent_id": "t0038.s01"
},
{
"start": 1684.68,
"end": 1688.7,
"speaker_label": "Diego Ferrer",
"text": "Choose one of the ideas we discussed and implement it for two weeks.",
"char_start": 6404,
"char_end": 6472,
"unit_id": "t0039.u01",
"sent_id": "t0039.s01"
},
{
"start": 1688.76,
"end": 1690.08,
"speaker_label": "Diego Ferrer",
"text": "Everything else is iteration.",
"char_start": 6473,
"char_end": 6502,
"unit_id": "t0039.u01",
"sent_id": "t0039.s02"
},
{
"start": 1690.08,
"end": 1693.8,
"speaker_label": "Lucía Herrera",
"text": "Before we close, thank you again to our friends at Linear.",
"char_start": 6518,
"char_end": 6576,
"unit_id": "t0040.u01",
"sent_id": "t0040.s01"
},
{
"start": 1693.86,
"end": 1698.96,
"speaker_label": "Lucía Herrera",
"text": "Linear is the issue tracking system designed for speed – built for the keyboard.",
"char_start": 6577,
"char_end": 6657,
"unit_id": "t0040.u01",
"sent_id": "t0040.s02"
},
{
"start": 1698.96,
"end": 1701.48,
"speaker_label": "Lucía Herrera",
"text": "Diego Ferrer, thank you for the conversation.",
"char_start": 6658,
"char_end": 6703,
"unit_id": "t0040.u01",
"sent_id": "t0040.s03"
},
{
"start": 1701.48,
"end": 1702.98,
"speaker_label": "Diego Ferrer",
"text": "Thank you, Lucía.",
"char_start": 6718,
"char_end": 6735,
"unit_id": "t0041.u01",
"sent_id": "t0041.s01"
},
{
"start": 1702.98,
"end": 1706.46,
"speaker_label": "Lucía Herrera",
"text": "That's all for today's episode of Trail Sessions.",
"char_start": 6751,
"char_end": 6800,
"unit_id": "t0042.u01",
"sent_id": "t0042.s01"
},
{
